    "name": "TASU Bowl",
    "steam_appid": 3607840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TASU Bowl</strong> is a deck-building game that combines roguelike elements with bowling.<br>Scoring over 300 points isn\u2019t just a dream\u2014it\u2019s totally possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How many games can you survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game sets a new target score.<br>To beat it, you\u2019ll upgrade and modify your balls, pins, frames, and items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/83ca42611c9ea2377747403b67378608.avif?t=1749609906\" width=384 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game ends, you can spend your hard-earned cash at the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/b5b7bc059beddd7b6ec092487f767419.avif?t=1749609906\" width=536 height=558 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Balls with wild effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The balls you throw are packed with special powers!<br>From high-scoring balls, giant balls, and ones with strange movement,<br>to balls that place gates or power up pins\u2014customize your deck to match your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/91512e7c6d580f440f443dc56f0d3dac.poster.avif?t=1749609906\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/91512e7c6d580f440f443dc56f0d3dac.webm?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/91512e7c6d580f440f443dc56f0d3dac.mp4?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/d27b63c91a64409bdc4e6aa8077b8d26.poster.avif?t=1749609906\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/d27b63c91a64409bdc4e6aa8077b8d26.webm?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/d27b63c91a64409bdc4e6aa8077b8d26.mp4?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/113c47062fba6ebf95c61ec84c1d5e05.avif?t=1749609906\" width=800 height=193 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lively pins with crazy abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pins can have their own effects too!<br>Some, like the \u201cZombie\u201d pin, come back to life even after being knocked down!<br>You can also increase or decrease the number of pins\u2014<br>go for a bigger knockdown or make it easier to hit strikes and spares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/a8c7a2030e6b9416aff7e9418067d3de.avif?t=1749609906\" width=434 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/678ec44c6f806c7f698c0a2a50e9d4af.avif?t=1749609906\" width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special frames with added twists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the <strong>frames</strong> where your scores are written can have unique effects!<br>We\u2019ve shortened the game to 4 frames instead of the usual 10 for casual play,<br>but you can buy more frames at the shop for a longer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/13f6438b17eb45bc39b8941c7644b3b4.avif?t=1749609906\" width=546 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose items to match your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items provide passive effects just by holding them,<br>while others can be activated at the perfect moment!<br>Get bonus points for strikes, or boost your next throw with powerful consumables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Image: In-game screen showing item icons and hover effects</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TASU Bowl</strong> is a deck-building game that combines roguelike elements with bowling.<br>Scoring over 300 points isn\u2019t just a dream\u2014it\u2019s totally possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How many games can you survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game sets a new target score.<br>To beat it, you\u2019ll upgrade and modify your balls, pins, frames, and items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/83ca42611c9ea2377747403b67378608.avif?t=1749609906\" width=384 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game ends, you can spend your hard-earned cash at the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/b5b7bc059beddd7b6ec092487f767419.avif?t=1749609906\" width=536 height=558 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Balls with wild effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The balls you throw are packed with special powers!<br>From high-scoring balls, giant balls, and ones with strange movement,<br>to balls that place gates or power up pins\u2014customize your deck to match your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/91512e7c6d580f440f443dc56f0d3dac.poster.avif?t=1749609906\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/91512e7c6d580f440f443dc56f0d3dac.webm?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/91512e7c6d580f440f443dc56f0d3dac.mp4?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/d27b63c91a64409bdc4e6aa8077b8d26.poster.avif?t=1749609906\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/d27b63c91a64409bdc4e6aa8077b8d26.webm?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/d27b63c91a64409bdc4e6aa8077b8d26.mp4?t=1749609906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/113c47062fba6ebf95c61ec84c1d5e05.avif?t=1749609906\" width=800 height=193 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lively pins with crazy abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pins can have their own effects too!<br>Some, like the \u201cZombie\u201d pin, come back to life even after being knocked down!<br>You can also increase or decrease the number of pins\u2014<br>go for a bigger knockdown or make it easier to hit strikes and spares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/a8c7a2030e6b9416aff7e9418067d3de.avif?t=1749609906\" width=434 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/678ec44c6f806c7f698c0a2a50e9d4af.avif?t=1749609906\" width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special frames with added twists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the <strong>frames</strong> where your scores are written can have unique effects!<br>We\u2019ve shortened the game to 4 frames instead of the usual 10 for casual play,<br>but you can buy more frames at the shop for a longer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/13f6438b17eb45bc39b8941c7644b3b4.avif?t=1749609906\" width=546 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose items to match your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items provide passive effects just by holding them,<br>while others can be activated at the perfect moment!<br>Get bonus points for strikes, or boost your next throw with powerful consumables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Image: In-game screen showing item icons and hover effects</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "TASU Bowl is a casual deck-building game that mixes bowling with roguelike elements. Use balls, pins, score frames, and items\u2014each with unique effects\u2014to take control of the game. It\u2019s not just about strikes and spares\u2014enjoy a whole new kind of bowling experience!",
